<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $2.1 bln in March 12 wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $2.1 bln in March 12 wk.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $2.1 billion to $802.4 billion in the week ended March 12, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
